kind: skit
id: cast-check-1
title: Studio Roll Call One
about: Tabby, Neon, Hertz, Tracker, Clank, Chip, and Cue test the hardwood stage floor and morning microphones

[scene 1]
tabby: "Testing one, two. Hardwood floor is solid under my boots today." ; do nod ; move left 2 ; cam wide
neon: "All seven neon tubes are warmed up and humming in tune." ; do cheer ; dance 2 ; cam two-shot
hertz: "Signal needle holds steady at green across every cable." ; do nod ; move right 2 ; cam closeup
tracker: "Tracking reels are aligned. Zero tape flutter on channel four." ; do tilt ; move wide-right 2 ; cam reaction

[scene 2]
clank: "My trench coat seams are dry and ready for a loud rehearsal." ; do shrug ; move wide-left 2 ; cam low-angle
chip: "Floppy drive booted fast! I even kept all my feathers." ; do cheer ; jump 1.5 ; cam closeup
cue: "Monitors crisp, bubbles live, every foot on the deck. Let's roll!" ; do bow ; react cheer ; celebrate 2.5 ; cam wide
